#: kio_smb_browse.cpp:67
msgid ""
"%1:\n"
"Unknown file type, neither directory or file."
msgstr ""
"%1:\n"
"Birem töre bilgesez, ul törgäk tä, birem dä tügel."

#: kio_smb_browse.cpp:126
#, c-format
msgid "File does not exist: %1"
msgstr "Bu birem barlıqta yuq: %1"

#: kio_smb_browse.cpp:242
msgid "Unable to find any workgroups in your local network."
msgstr "Cirle çiltäreñdä eş törkemeneñ bersen dä tabıp bulmadı."

#: kio_smb_browse.cpp:249
#, c-format
msgid "No media in device for %1"
msgstr "%1 cıhazında taşılma yuq"

#: kio_smb_browse.cpp:257
#, c-format
msgid "Could not connect to host for %1"
msgstr "%1 öçen host belän totaşılıp bulmadı."

#: kio_smb_browse.cpp:273
#, c-format
msgid "Error while connecting to server responsible for %1"
msgstr "%1 öçen cawaplı servergä totaşqanda xata kilep çıqtı"

#: kio_smb_browse.cpp:281
msgid "Share could not be found on given server"
msgstr "Bu serverdä büleşengänne tabıp bulmí"

#: kio_smb_browse.cpp:284
msgid "BAD File descriptor"
msgstr "Birem totqıçı BOZIQ"

#: kio_smb_browse.cpp:288
msgid ""
"The given name could not be resolved to a unique server. Make sure your network "
"is setup without any name conflicts between names used by Windows and by UNIX "
"name resolution."
msgstr ""
"Birelgän atamanı berdäm server adresenä äyländerep bulmí. Biredäge çeltärneñ "
"Windows belän UNIX serverlärendä sanaq adın isäpläwdä qarşılıqlar bulmawın "
"tikşerep alırğa bula."

#: kio_smb_browse.cpp:294
msgid ""
"libsmbclient reported an error, but did not specify what the problem is. This "
"might indicate a severe problem with your network - but also might indicate a "
"problem with libsmbclient.\n"
"If you want to help us, please provide a tcpdump of the network interface while "
"you try to browse (be aware that it might contain private data, so do not post "
"it if you are unsure about that - you can send it privately to the developers "
"if they ask for it)"
msgstr ""
"libsmbclient tuplaması xata turında belderep, anıñ çığış urının äytmäde. Ul "
"qíınlıq yä çeltärdä, yä şul libsmbclient tuplamasınıñ üzendä bula ala.\n"
"Bezgä bulışası kilsä, çeltärne küzätep qarağanda, tcpdump yazılımınıñ çığımın "
"kiterergä kiräk. Belderü: tcpdump çığımında serlär buluı bar, şuña kürä anı "
"teläsä qaya taratası tügel, citeşterüçelär sorasalar ğına, anı alarğa turı itep "
"cibäräse."

#: kio_smb_browse.cpp:305
#, c-format
msgid "Unknown error condition in stat: %1"
msgstr "Nöfüstä xata öçen bilgesez şart: %1"

#: kio_smb_mount.cpp:125 kio_smb_mount.cpp:166
